      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Wait this would actually be really cool. Creators could have followers and be able to check a feed which shows when public avis / worlds of theirs has received an update, and the SDK could be updated to add a 'update note' section. On top of that, users can optionally subscribe to the feed to receive notifications for all the creators updates (avi + world) or specifically for a world.",
